
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber

  actor       Orch as "Orchestrator (tar_make)"
  participant ZO   as "Zotero API"
  participant OA   as "OpenAlex API"
  participant SS   as "OpenAlex snapshot (local)"
  participant TEI  as "RunPod TEI (SPECTER2)"
  participant R2   as "Cloudflare R2"
  participant BT   as "RunPod BERTopic (cuml GPU)"

  rect rgb(245,250,255)
    note over Orch,SS: Stage 1 - Corpus assembly (per assessment: tca, nxs)
    Orch ->> ZO:  download_zotero_assessment() (TCA public, NXS private)
    ZO  -->> Orch: items + tags -> zotero/assessment=*/chapter=*
    Orch ->> OA:  get_ids_from_dois() - resolve DOIs to OpenAlex ids
    OA  -->> Orch: id list -> ids/assessment=*
    Orch ->> SS:  get_corpus_from_snapshot(ids)
    SS  -->> Orch: full records (+ Zotero fallback for unmatched)
    note over Orch: -> corpus/assessment=*/chapter=*
  end

  rect rgb(255,250,235)
    note over Orch,TEI: Stage 2 - Embedding (per assessment x variant x chapter)
    Orch ->> TEI: POST /embed (batched, concurrent) - corpus + keypapers
    TEI -->> Orch: 768-D SPECTER2 vectors
    Orch ->> Orch: duckdb COPY -> part-*.parquet, .embed_complete marker
  end

  rect rgb(240,255,245)
    note over Orch,R2: Stage 3 - R2 sync
    Orch ->> R2: rclone sync embeddings -> s3://nxs-tca-article/embeddings/
    note over Orch,R2: corpus excludes No Chapter - keypapers always
    R2  -->> Orch: 200 OK
  end

  rect rgb(255,245,245)
    note over Orch: Stage 4 - Keypaper scoring (local)
    Orch ->> Orch: score_keypapers() - cosine corpus vs keypapers (per variant)
    Orch ->> Orch: score_keypapers_combined() - per assessment/chapter (title_abstract + title fallback)
  end

  rect rgb(250,240,255)
    note over Orch,BT: Stage 5 - BERTopic clustering (RunPod)
    Orch ->> BT: ssh + rsync cfg.yaml, exec run_bertopic_gpu.py [s3 URIs]
    BT  ->> R2:  duckdb httpfs read_parquet(s3) - dedup by id
    R2  -->> BT: corpus + fallback embeddings (streamed)
    BT  -->> BT: cuml UMAP + HDBSCAN + c-TF-IDF
    Orch ->> BT: rsync topic parquets back -> topics/...
  end

  rect rgb(245,245,255)
    note over Orch: Stage 6 - Visualisation + reports
    Orch ->> Orch: viz_* / tbl_* targets
    Orch ->> Orch: render Embedding, Chapter Analysis, Topic Modelling reports
    Orch ->> Orch: render index (NXS TCS Article Report) -> output/reports/
  end
